{"id":"pedazo","lemma":"pedazo","pos":"noun","rank":1338,"glosses":["piece, chunk, hunk, bit, bite (a part of a larger whole)","patch (e.g. of sky, cloth, skin, space)","scrap (e.g. of paper, information)"],"ipa":"/peˈdaθo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pedazos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/34/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-pedazo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Aquí hay un pedazo de papel.","en":"Here's a piece of paper.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/462185","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"paper"}]},{"text":"Se hizo pedazos.","en":"It fell to pieces.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78226","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null]},{"text":"Ella rompió la carta en mil pedazos.","en":"She tore the letter into a thousand pieces.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693478","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to break","l":"romper"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"letter"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"thousand"},null]},{"text":"¿Te importaría escribirlo en este pedazo de papel?","en":"Would you mind writing it down on this piece of paper?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937515","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to matter","l":"importar"},{"g":"to write","l":"escribir"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"paper"}]},{"text":"Mi vida se cae a pedazos.","en":"My life is falling apart.","words":[null,null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to fall","l":"caer"},{"g":"to"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"my honey, my love"]]}]}